<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes have spread from the Northwest and Southwest into Yaounde, Douala and Maroua as security forces confront Ambazonian separatists, while separatist attacks continue in the Anglophone regions. The government has deployed the Rapid Intervention Battalion to the Lake Chad region and urged drones and joint border patrols to secure the Nigeria-Cameroon border. Femicide rates have risen sharply, prompting protests and demands for legal reform, and UNESCO is involved in prevention efforts. A teacher died two months after her wedding while her husband faces a murder charge, adding to public unrest. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOYXIwZEx6THl4Y1REWnV2TFVhWnVpVVJHdzJGSExjTVZUV2ZDeGw1NUx4OV9zTlQtbUlPank5cGJ6TG9qR0Rqd1dTZzdjTEd6XzdtMU9TMXhDeWJrbHRQS1lZNXdGTHZOaWxRcTRNdEdHdi1UbGdoQjhWaS01NHJNTWswT0dZOFk2?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQUDl4TnJLU296QjdJNWJHVHk1ZDZIUU5rdDUzazZnelJLU1o5LUlndEt6TGhQRENFR1FRV0pPZ1NSUWVrYlhCemR1WVhCVzN1UDEyWFJBZXV2bXB5NWJmRDNjeWljTWc3b09QWlZGUDA1ekpZMU9BNnZOVEtvMHFCeHF5a2tpd1R6MjZSUm81NTY2WTNFaGpr?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNbnYxWm51b2ZqaXRuWFlxSzNXOWZjUWUtSEgzdm1ZSzRkUUxPNFl4eGc1dkZQc3prR0tqaWoxOWJPbU51VzlDeTFmLWtKVnVoZHh2ZXFfY3VXRGxQU01Mb3hwck5aMzh2NGQwTFBGZ2cxdFRPRjRiS1FpdFpXV2RfLVMxSHVnMTMzUEhPVFF6S1NrUXVLNGtMWThZODBzZW4zQ29VbTlR?oc=5&quot;&gt;CameroonOnline.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQcDRpQWtueWxhX3lCYm0ydHpLRWEzVGZkdlNHVC1tQU9ndmhaOXJIVE4tWmo2ODRicnR4RFlyV3NocTRidnZZNjFnekdERlZuSFFJOTNjcVBRWWUydnJLNHVtdE1pcmRUSmozNHVKMWl3aU5QN2JXMGxRQXFkb0dmRVZHOUhfTEt